<title>NEW ZEALAND: Air NZ changes schedules ahead of possible strikes.</title>
<headline>Air NZ changes schedules ahead of possible strikes.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air New Zealand said on Tuesday several international flight departure times for Wednesday had been changed in anticipation of stopwork meetings by the company's ground staff.</p>
<p>Departure times had been brought forward an hour for flights NZ81 from Auckland to Brisbane and Seoul, NZ183 from Christchurch to Sydney and Los Angeles, and NZ155 from Wellington to Melbourne.</p>
<p>Air New Zealand said departures by other international flights on Wednesday may be delayed by up to four hours by the stopwork meetings.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
